Kapal Hantu Ourang Medan — Zaa Story (Shadow Puppetry style)

Picture: drawn entirely in code. Hide-carving tools (carve.js), lamp/cloth compositor (gl.js) and backstage silhouettes
  (backstage.js) adapted from the Lemo-Opuscar library's Shadow Puppetry demo, MIT License (LICENSES/MIT.txt in that library).
Font: Cormorant Garamond — Christian Thalmann, SIL Open Font License 1.1 (fonts/OFL-CormorantGaramond.txt), via google/fonts.
Narration: OmniVoice (local TTS on the owner's laptop), voice profile "misteri-cewe" of Zaa Office.
Music samples (CC0 1.0): VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition (Versilian Studios) — gong, log drum;
  Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios) — frame drum.
Synthesised in code (no licence needed): gong ageng, metallophone bars, rebab-like fiddle, Morse tones, sea, fire, foley.
No third-party images, footage or map data are used. The ship, crew and props are original drawings, not real photographs.
